OL,3,GNEWSAChampions recognised at Make a
OL,4,ADifference awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight community champions from across
OL,7,FKent have been honoured at a BBC Make a
OL,8,FDifference Awards event.
OL,10,FThe winners in each of the eight
OL,11,Fcategories have collected their awards
OL,12,Fat a sparkling ceremony at Folkestone's
OL,13,FQuarterhouse, where the event was
OL,14,Fhosted by BBC Radio Kent's Breakfast
OL,15,Fpresenter Dominic King.
OL,17,FNow in its fifth year, the Make a
OL,18,FDifference Awards honour and recognise
OL,19,Fthose who go the extra mile to improve
OL,20,Flife across the county.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
