OL,3,GNEWSAChampions recognised at Make a
OL,4,ADifference awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the hundreds of nominations
OL,7,Fsubmitted, 31 finalists were chosen,
OL,8,Fwith the winners announced on Tuesday
OL,9,Fnight. Award categories included
OL,10,FCommunity Group, Young Hero and
OL,11,FFundraiser.
